                "text": "Yesterday, I heard from Cowlitz County emergency response and care leaders about how we can stop the spread of fentanyl and build a brighter future for those suffering from addiction.\n\nWe've got to make it easier to access treatment than to access these substances, which is why I'm fighting to secure our borders and cosponsored bipartisan bills which are now law to target fentanyl traffickers and fight smuggling at ports of entry.",
